{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The mirror preserves the ring’s cursor and gap outcomes as claimed. I found a more consequential issue in the follower rule: an uninstalled trace raises the same floor used to reject later heads, so a failed sequence check can block valid heads. I’m checking the load lifecycle and publication paths to pin down the consequences."}}
